<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 7.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 7.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	14.71    1.70</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.20    2.45</p>
<p> 3   Natl Consol	     9.57    0.94</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.26    0.81</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.18    1.06</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.85    1.14</p>
